  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "SysAid is an ITSM and employee service-desk platform (incidents, requests, assets, automation) for internal IT. The first-party pricing page is quote-led; 2026 listings commonly cite Professional around $89/agent/month — treat as medium-confidence, not a self-serve tile with Freshservice’s certainty. Enterprise is custom with a published 20-agent minimum. Free trial. Same itsm-service-desk cluster as ServiceNow and Freshservice — this entity does not outrank ServiceNow 8.7 or Freshservice 8.4. Distinct from HaloITSM’s all-in-one UK calculator and from ManageEngine’s $13 Standard floor.",
